cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pflacco in any capacity, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "pflacco: A Python implementation and extension to the R package flacco for computing ELA features"
abstract: "pflacco provides a set of numerical features to characterize single-objective continuous and constrained optimization problems. These features can be used to develop an understanding of a given problem instance and serve as the basis for automated algorithm selection and configuration."
type: software
